      "description": "A man in a gray cardigan sits facing a woman with brown shoulder-length hair and a pink top whose back is to the camera; their hands are clasped on the table between them and his expression is serious and downcast. The shot holds on the pair in a quiet, somber beat as a voice-over recap mentions Barney meeting a girl named Quinn and Kevin un-proposing to Robin.",
