      "start_seconds": 9.259,
      "end_seconds": 12.763,
      "description": "At night on an outdoor patio illuminated by string lights with a city skyline in the background, a man in a sweater stands facing a woman in a black coat. He confesses his love for her, addressing her by name, and then mentions asking if she loved him back. The camera cuts between a wide shot of the pair and close-ups of their faces during the conversation.",
