    {
      "id": 5,
      "start_seconds": 12.763,
      "end_seconds": 16.391,
      "description": "In an apartment living room, a dark-haired man in a dark striped sweater sits on a couch speaking earnestly to a woman with shoulder-length brown hair wearing a tan blazer (frame_000026\u2013frame_000029, shot_0009). The camera cuts to a reverse angle of the woman, who listens with a pained, concerned expression (frame_000030\u2013frame_000033, shot_0010). The subtitles show a serious personal exchange: one line recalls asking 'if she loved me back,' and the next reports that 'Marshall told Robin, \"You gotta move out\"' (text_0003, text_0004), indicating a weighty relationship conversation.",
